# Maintenance enhancements (prep — implement in slices)

Do **not** start unrelated phases. Ship in order below so Status/dashboard have real Approved + catalog data.

## Shared understanding (current baseline)
- Workflow today: `due` → `in_progress` → `done` | `skipped` (Start before Done; Cancel start; field locked after Done).
- Line kinds today: `part` | `labor` | `other` (free description + qty/price/cost) — **no catalog yet**.
- No `approved` status yet; Completed = `done`.
- Status panel: link to `/maintenance` only; no Maint column.
- Next-cycle spawn: due rolled from **completion + interval**; unassigned until manager assigns. **One-time / Demand** jobs have no intervals → no spawn. **End series** / **Stop all open for vehicle** skip open jobs and clear intervals (history kept).

