## Slice C — Status panel column **Maintenance**

### Product
Additional column on Last Status named **Maintenance**.

Cell values (priority / worst open or latest closed — pick one rule and stick to it):

| Display | Meaning |
|---------|---------|
| **In progress** | Open job `in_progress` for vehicle |
| **Due** / **Overdue** / **Upcoming** | Open `due` job schedule health |
| **Done** | Latest closed is `done` (awaiting Approve), no open jobs |
| **Approved** | Latest closed is `approved`, no open jobs |
| **—** | No maintenance events |

If both open and closed exist, **open wins** (In progress / Due / Overdue / Upcoming).

### API
`GET /api/maintenance/status-summary?userIds=1,2,3`

```json
{
  "byUserId": {
    "123": {
      "label": "Overdue",
      "status": "due",
      "health": "overdue",
      "eventId": "uuid",
      "title": "…"
    }
  }
}
```

### UI
- Column **Maintenance** in `LastStatusPanel` (not only a text link).
- Pill + link to job or vehicle-filtered `/maintenance`.
- Fail soft if API errors.

### Checklist
- [x] status-summary API (open + latest done/approved)
- [x] Column UI + colors
- [x] Depends on Slice B for **Approved** label (until then map only to Done / open health)

